          "guid": "mt7lh8r1rboxqplg",
          "message": {
            "text": "The adjudication artifact binds both levels of evidence: raw SHA-256/length identities for every input file, then a canonical self-hash over the sorted inputs and pure six-arm verdict. Sorting by OS/role makes the report independent of CLI argument order, and exclusive creation prevents a rerun from silently overwriting retained evidence.",
            "markdown": "The adjudication artifact binds both levels of evidence: raw SHA-256/length identities for every input file, then a canonical self-hash over the sorted inputs and pure six-arm verdict. Sorting by OS/role makes the report independent of CLI argument order, and exclusive creation prevents a rerun from silently overwriting retained evidence."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "tools/animated-image-owner-resource-truth-adjudicator.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 45,
                  "endLine": 92,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "function readReport(path: string): {\n  input: AnimatedImageTruthAdjudicationInput;\n  report: AnimatedImageTruthRunReport;\n} {\n  const bytes = readFileSync(resolve(path));\n  return {\n    input: {\n      pathToken: basename(path),\n      byteLength: bytes.byteLength,\n      sha256: createHash(\"sha256\").update(bytes).digest(\"hex\"),\n    },\n    report: JSON.parse(bytes.toString(\"utf8\")) as AnimatedImageTruthRunReport,\n  };\n}\n\nexport function runAnimatedImageOwnerResourceTruthAdjudicator(\n  artifactPaths: string[],\n): AnimatedImageTruthAdjudicationArtifact {\n  const inputs = artifactPaths.map(readReport).sort((left, right) =>\n    `${left.report.operatingSystem}/${left.report.evidenceRole}`.localeCompare(\n      `${right.report.operatingSystem}/${right.report.evidenceRole}`,\n    ));\n  const payload = {\n    schemaVersion: 1 as const,\n    ticket: \"DM-2583\" as const,\n    stage: \"animated-image-owner-resource-truth-adjudication\" as const,\n    inputs: inputs.map((input) => input.input),\n    adjudication: adjudicateAnimatedImageOwnerResourceTruth(\n      inputs.map((input) => input.report),\n    ),\n  };\n  return { ...payload, reportSha256: animatedImageTruthSha256(payload) };\n}\n\nfunction runCli(): void {\n  const argv = process.argv.slice(2);\n  const artifactPaths = argumentValues(argv, \"--artifact\");\n  if (artifactPaths.length === 0) {\n    throw new Error(\"at least one --artifact path is required\");\n  }\n  const report = runAnimatedImageOwnerResourceTruthAdjudicator(artifactPaths);\n  const reportPath = argumentValue(argv, \"--report\");\n  if (reportPath != null) {\n    writeFileSync(\n      resolve(reportPath),\n      `${JSON.stringify(report, null, 2)}\\n`,\n      { flag: \"wx\" },\n    );"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
